  <h2>Former success formula is the basis for a golden future</h2>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">BT TECHNIEK, IMMOCON and PINSO BENELUX — all well-known suppliers of machinery, ovens and after-sales (SAV) service within the bakery industry — have decided to join forces to support the strong growth through after-sales service adapted to the needs of their customers today.</p>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">Through the acquisition of BAKKERIJ TECHNIEK BVBA, they have created an ideal base for the continued expansion of their activities within the craft, industrial bakery, retail and bake shops in Belgium, the Netherlands and Luxembourg. The current owner of the successful business, Mr. Rik Borghijs, has agreed to assist the new owners with his knowledge and experience during the first few years.</p>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">The unique and exclusive collaboration with BEKO ensures that customers and prospective customers for BAKKERIJ TECHNIEK bvba can count on an ideal mix of value and a great variety of high quality bakery machines and ovens of famous brands.</p>
  <p>In addition, exclusivity was obtained from:</p>
  <ul class="fancy-list">
    <li><strong>REVENT</strong> — Rotary rack ovens and vacuum cooling</li>
    <li><strong>KORNFEIL</strong> — Ovens up to 12 floors (up to 60m² baking surface), thermical oil ovens, tunnel ovens, handling and automation</li>
    <li><strong>CONBAKESTONE</strong> — A new type of oven for the artisanal and semi-industrial bakery. Only one oven — 3 baking methods!</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Learn more: <a href="mailto:info@bakkerijtechniek.be" style="color:#2c5282;">info@bakkerijtechniek.be</a> — Tel: +32 (0) 14 314 941</p>
